# Review Rules

- Use `schemas/review.schema.yaml` for all review docs.
- Possible verdicts: APPROVE, REQUEST_CHANGES, BLOCK.
- BLOCK if: security issue, data loss risk, no tests for changed code.
- REQUEST_CHANGES if: style, naming, missing edge case, minor design issue.
- Save to `docs/reviews/YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>-review.md`.
